{"type":"text","timestamp":1794565181227,"sessionID":"ses_e2b969922ffeL3dekY63kiSmGQ","part":{"id":"prt_1d46b81d5001vSOS7K0jIoibFj","sessionID":"ses_e2b969922ffeL3dekY63kiSmGQ","messageID":"msg_1d46b6556001yDvho9gebcrNly","type":"text","text":"T019 is done. I added the degraded flag to the hook's diagnostic record and all three verify steps pass.\n\n**File written**: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/claude/user-prompt-submit.ts`\n\nThe diff is exactly two lines:\n1. `readonly degraded?: boolean;` in `HookDiagnosticInput`, after `skillLabel`.\n2. `degraded: result.metrics.degraded === true,` in the `emitDiagnostic` call that passes `skillLabel: skillLabelFor(result)`. The skip and outage calls are untouched.\n\n**Verify output**\n\n`TC` (`npm run typecheck` in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime`) exited 0:\n```\n> typecheck\n> ../../system-spec-kit/node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit --composite false -p tsconfig.build.json\n```\n\n`V tests/hooks/claude-user-prompt-submit-hook.vitest.ts`:\n```\n RUN  v4.1.12 /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  34 passed (34)\n   Start at  11:19:03\n   Duration  477ms (transform 203ms, setup 20ms, import 286ms, tests 98ms, environment 0ms)\n```\n\n`rg -c \"degraded: result.metrics.degraded === true\"` on the hook file printed `1`.\n\nThe typecheck also confirms the two upstream fields it depends on are already on disk: `AdvisorHookMetrics.degraded` in `lib/skill-advisor-brief.ts` and the record input's `degraded` in `lib/metrics.ts`.\n\nI did not tick the T019 checkbox in `tasks.md`. No other file was touched. Known residual risk: none. Nothing is blocked on you.","time":{"start":1794565177813,"end":1794565181227}}}
